The D1/Cosmos runtime and tests were adapted from the Jetson Thor D1 + Cosmos
event-agent demo for this VSS deployment. The model weights and the NVIDIA
container layers are obtained by the deployer from their corresponding registries.
See model-lock.json for the LiquidAI/d1-2B checkpoint revision:
https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/d1-2B

The VSS RT-VLM service supplies the Cosmos model under the upstream model and
container terms. See the repository's LICENSE and LICENSE-3rd-party.txt for VSS
notices. The optional prompt assistant connects to a user-provided Nemotron model endpoint.
